{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56291","headline":"无题 · 王肱","name":"无题","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"茆屋江山上，夜来梦吴越。\n岩溜穿白云，桂花落明月。\n子规啼空山，一声一滴血。\n何事□秋风，出门又离别。\n（见《吟窗杂录》卷二九《历代吟谱》。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王肱","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56291.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56291","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}